# Simulate Before Send

No state-changing transaction may be submitted until:

1. `eth_call` or tenderly simulation succeeds
2. Gas estimate completes without revert
3. Guardrails in `guardrails/web3-guardrails.yaml` pass

If simulation fails, stop and report the revert reason. Do not retry with higher gas without fixing the root cause.
